# Runtime and build directory (U-13).
#
# Everything in here is generated: build artefacts under cache/ (bundled
# specification, compiled route table, checksum) and tool caches. Nothing is
# checked in — but the directory itself is, because U-13 requires it to exist and
# be writable, and a deployment that had to create it would fail on first request.
*
!.gitignore
# Exception: the deny rule from U-25 must travel with the checkout, otherwise a
# deployment into the web root would expose build artefacts and tool caches.
!.htaccess
